type: software
title: "turkish-linguistic-features"
abstract: >-
  A toolkit for extracting quantitative linguistic features from Turkish and
  English text: 214 features for Turkish, 181 for English. 203 of the Turkish
  features cite a source in the literature; the rest are plain definitions.
